  "question": {
    "text": "The resonance frequency of LCR series a.c. circuit is <math><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></math> Now the capacitance is made&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> times, then the new resonance frequency will become",
